iers now have static\ncanonical records; deviations name the job, step, and first differing line.\nExisting specialized and sequence checks remain. Live-derived mutations and\nrecord controls exercise the pins, and policy states their maintenance cost.\n\n## Authoritative references\n\n#407 and its public AC5 correction; REQUIREMENTS.md section 8;\nCONTRIBUTING.md section 3; CI_WORKFLOWS.md items 1, 2, 4, 11, and 12.\n\n## How to get into the same state\n\nCheck out the commit above and initialize the three required pinned submodules:\n\n```sh\ngit submodule update --init third_party/verilog-axis protocol-processor gptp-processor\n```\n\n## How to validate\n\n```sh\npython3 scripts/ci_events.py --check\npython3 scripts/ci_events.py --selftest\npython3 -B scripts/docs_check.py\npython3 scripts/gen_toc.py --check\npython3 scripts/check_doc_paths.py\npython3 scripts/check_py_idiom.py\n```\n\nExpected: zero contract/documentation/idiom findings and a passing selftest.\nFocused results and remaining validation belong in the evidence comment.\n\n## Known limitations / out of scope\n\nWorkflow commands and semantics are unchanged. Seven-RTL-job script expansion\nremains #439. Physical calibration and field-campaign checks remain explicitly unrun.\nReady exhaustive CI and independent review remain mandatory.\n\n## Definition of Done\n\n- [x] Changed behavior has self-checking tests and updated policy.\n- [x] Focused author validation passes.\n- [x] Measured AC5, complete native gates and local fast replicas pass.\n- [ ] Ready exhaustive local and hosted checks pass.\n- [ ] Evidence is published and independent reviews cover all five lenses.\n- [ ] Candidate validation, authorized merge, and containment complete.\n","created_at":"2026-09-22T03:49:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T05:06:38Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c999be9f7d2a3c897a99e00c15a896f13fefb565","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draf